<view class="page">
  <view class="brand-row"><view class="brand"><text class="brand-mark">雀</text><view><text class="brand-title">雀有腔</text><text class="brand-en">MAHJONG SOUNDS</text></view></view><button class="about-link" bindtap="showAbout">乡音收集所 ↗</button></view>
  <view class="hero"><view class="hero-ring"></view><view class="eyebrow">● 蜀山四川麻将 · 原声收集</view><view class="hero-title"><view>四川麻将原声，</view><view>一句就有牌桌味。</view></view><view class="hero-description">催人出牌、接梗调侃，每一句都有自己的腔调。</view><button class="hero-button" bindtap="randomPlay">随便听一声 ↗</button><view class="tile-art"><view class="art-tile art-green">發<text>好运发生</text></view><view class="art-tile art-red">中<text>一声入魂</text></view></view><text class="hero-bottom">把家乡话，带上牌桌。</text></view>
  <view class="nav"><button class="nav-button {{view === 'all' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-view="all" bindtap="selectView">音效广场</button><button class="nav-button {{view === 'favorites' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-view="favorites" bindtap="selectView">我的收藏 <text wx:if="{{favorites.length}}">{{favorites.length}}</text></button><button class="nav-button {{view === 'recent' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-view="recent" bindtap="selectView">最近播放</button></view>
  <view class="collection-groups"><button wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="id" class="collection-group {{group === item.id ? 'group-active' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectGroup">{{item.name}}</button></view>
  <view class="search"><text class="search-icon">⌕</text><input value="{{query}}" bindinput="search" placeholder="搜一搜，想听哪一声" placeholder-class="placeholder" confirm-type="search"/><button wx:if="{{query}}" bindtap="clearSearch" class="clear-search" aria-label="清空搜索">×</button></view>
  <view class="library-tools"><button class="filter-trigger" bindtap="openFilters">筛选 <text>⌄</text></button><button class="sort" bindtap="toggleSort">⇅ {{sort === 'name' ? '名称' : '默认'}}</button></view>
  <view class="sound-grid"><view wx:for="{{sounds}}" wx:key="id" class="sound-cell"><view class="sound-card {{current.id === item.id && playing ? 'is-playing' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="playCard" aria-role="button" aria-label="试听{{item.dialectName}}{{item.title}}"><view class="card-top"><view class="card-glyph" style="color:{{item.color}}">{{item.glyph}}</view><button class="favorite {{item.favorite ? 'favorited' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="favorite" aria-label="{{item.favorite ? '取消收藏' : '收藏'}}">{{item.favorite ? '♥' : '♡'}}</button></view><view class="card-title"><text class="card-title-text">{{item.text || item.title}}</text></view><view class="card-note"><text class="category-tag">{{item.category}}</text></view><button wx:if="{{item.variants.length > 1}}" class="variant-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="chooseVariant">{{item.variants.length}} 个版本 ▾</button><view class="card-bottom"><text class="dialect-tag" style="color:{{item.color}}">{{item.dialectName}}</text><text class="duration-label">{{item.durationLabel}}</text><view class="wave {{current.id === item.id && playing ? 'wave-playing' : ''}}"><view></view><view></view><view></view><view></view><view></view><view></view><view></view></view><text class="play-circle">{{current.id === item.id && playing ? 'Ⅱ' : '▶'}}</text></view></view></view></view>
  <button wx:if="{{hasMore}}" class="load-more" bindtap="loadMore">继续加载 · 已显示 {{sounds.length}} / {{count}}</button>
  <view wx:if="{{!count}}" class="empty"><text class="empty-icon">听</text><view class="empty-title">{{emptyTitle}}</view><view class="empty-message">{{emptyMessage}}</view><button bindtap="reset" class="reset-button">看看全部音效 ↗</button></view>
  <view class="collection-note"><text>● 声音有方言，快乐无门槛</text><text>蜀山四川麻将 · 游戏原声</text></view><view class="footer">雀有腔 · 把家乡话，带上牌桌。</view>
</view>
<view class="player"><slider class="player-progress" value="{{progress}}" min="0" max="100" step="0.1" activeColor="#b53b2d" backgroundColor="#e8e5dd" block-size="12" bindchange="seek"/><view class="player-main"><view class="player-glyph">{{current ? current.glyph : '听'}}</view><view class="player-info"><view class="player-title">{{current ? current.title : '好腔调，等你来听'}}</view><view class="player-subtitle">{{current ? current.dialectName + ' · ' + current.durationLabel + ' · 原声' : '点击卡片，听一声家乡话'}}</view></view><button class="player-loop {{loop ? 'loop-active' : ''}}" bindtap="toggleLoop" aria-label="单条循环">↻</button><button class="player-play" bindtap="togglePlay" aria-label="{{playing ? '暂停' : '播放'}}">{{loading ? '···' : playing ? 'Ⅱ' : '▶'}}</button><button class="player-next" bindtap="next" aria-label="下一条">▸▏</button></view><view class="player-details"><text>{{elapsed}} / {{duration}}</text><text class="volume-label">音量</text><slider class="volume-slider" min="0" max="100" value="{{volume}}" activeColor="#b53b2d" backgroundColor="#e8e5dd" block-size="12" bindchange="changeVolume"/><button class="player-heart {{currentFavorite ? 'favorited' : ''}}" disabled="{{!current}}" bindtap="favorite">{{currentFavorite ? '♥' : '♡'}}</button></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{about}}" class="modal-mask" bindtap="closeAbout"><view class="modal" catchtap="noop"><view class="modal-brand">雀</view><view class="modal-title">一张牌，一句家乡话。</view><view class="modal-text">按内容、角色和性别整理的四川麻将原声音效库。聊天台词优先展示，同一内容的不同版本可单独试听。</view><view class="source-note"><view class="source-title">关于这套音频</view><view>全部音频来自你提供的「蜀山四川麻将_语音」素材，包含四川男女声、锅子哥哥、普通男女声，以及互动、对局、活动音效和背景音乐。</view><view class="source-paragraph">台词文字由本机语音识别辅助整理，仅供搜索参考，方言可能有识别偏差，请以原声为准。收藏与记录仅保存在当前设备。</view></view><button class="modal-confirm" bindtap="closeAbout">好，开桌！</button></view></view>

<view wx:if="{{filterOpen}}" class="filter-mask" bindtap="closeFilters"><view class="filter-sheet" catchtap="noop"><view class="sheet-heading"><text>筛选声音</text><button class="sheet-close" bindtap="closeFilters" aria-label="关闭筛选">×</button></view><view class="sheet-label">内容</view><view class="sheet-options"><view class="sheet-choice-cell" wx:for="{{groupCategories}}" wx:key="*this"><button class="sheet-option {{category === item ? 'sheet-selected' : ''}}" data-category="{{item}}" bindtap="selectCategory">{{item === '全部音效' ? '全部内容' : item}}</button></view></view><block wx:if="{{group !== 'effects'}}"><view class="sheet-label">角色</view><view class="sheet-options"><view class="sheet-choice-cell" wx:for="{{dialects}}" wx:key="id" wx:if="{{item.id !== 'effects'}}"><button class="sheet-option {{dialect === item.id ? 'sheet-selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectDialect">{{item.name}}</button></view></view><view class="sheet-label">性别</view><view class="sheet-options"><view class="sheet-choice-cell" wx:for="{{genders}}" wx:key="id" wx:if="{{item.id !== 'none' || group === 'tiles'}}"><button class="sheet-option {{gender === item.id ? 'sheet-selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectGender">{{item.id === 'none' ? '提示音效' : item.name}}</button></view></view></block><view class="sheet-actions"><button class="sheet-reset" bindtap="resetFilters">重置</button><button class="sheet-done" bindtap="closeFilters">查看 {{count}} 个声音</button></view></view></view>
